{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24373","headline":"同梦得暮春寄贺东西川二杨尚书 · 白居易","name":"同梦得暮春寄贺东西川二杨尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙节对持真可爱，雁行相接更堪夸。\n两川风景同三月，千里江山属一家。\n鲁卫定知连气色，潘杨亦觉有光华。\n应怜洛下分司伴，冷宴闲游老看花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}